    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p><strong>In early March 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure&nbsp;SQL:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-sql/database/automated-backups-overview?tabs=single-database#configure-backup-storage-redundancy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zone (ZRS) and Local (LRS) backup storage redundancy options are now available with Azure SQL Hyperscale Database</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In early March 2022, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nZone (ZRS) and Local (LRS) backup storage redundancy options are now available with Azure SQL Hyperscale Database ."
  },
